Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?redesign(admin):=20phase=202=20primitives=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20controls,=20cards,=20tables,=20dialogs?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Visual-only pass over the reusable admin patterns (guide section 8):
- buttons (primary/ghost/danger via data-tone), inputs, selects, checkbox/radio
- cards, stat cards with icon tiles, badges and chips from a tone mapping
- tables as bordered cards with a muted header, row hover, scroll shadows and
  no clipped final row; pagination, filter toolbar, dialogs and bottom sheets
- alerts, empty states, details/drawer, code blocks, detail-page key-value rows
No behaviour, label, action or data change.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
